# FORMAT: Surge Ruleset
# TOTAL: 17

# ======= Manual Rules ========
# Hand-curated ad-serving hosts, rejected with pre-matching (see Conf/Linnux.conf).
# Only pure ad-delivery endpoints observed in real traffic belong here.
# Do NOT add attribution / deep-link / anti-fraud / crash-report hosts
# (adjust, branch.io, siftscience, online-metrix, zimperium, sentry):
# blocking them breaks app links, payments or banking apps.
# Rewarded-video ads in games stop working when their network is listed here.

# Google AdMob (observed 2026-11-07/08 on iPhone)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,app-ads-services.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,g.doubleclick-cn.net

# Mobile game ad networks (observed 2026-11-07/08 on iPhone)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adsmoloco.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,inner-active.mobi
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,inmobi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,liftoff-creatives.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,4dvertible.com

# Pangle (ByteDance overseas ad network) static assets
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,i18n-pglstatp.com

# Added from 10 days of observer history (2026-10-30 ~ 11-08)
# Google ad serving (not imasdk.googleapis.com: video players depend on it)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,doubleclick.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlesyndication.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlesyndication-cn.com

# More mobile game ad networks / mediation
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,applovin.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fyber.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pangle.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mtgglobals.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dsp-api.moloco.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,adcolony.com
